      "STYLE_BASE": "固定不变"
    },
    "negativeBase": "text, letters, chinese characters, handwriting, signage, shop sign, logo, brand, watermark, subtitles, captions; close-up, extreme close-up, macro, product shot, hero still life object, isolated object on table; HDR, oversaturated, vivid colors, neon oversaturation, heavy clarity, crushed blacks, teal and orange grading; identifiable face, frontal portrait, direct eye contact, headshot; person cropped by frame edge, subject reduced to a tiny distant dot, distant fragment of a scene; fully blurred unreadable background, bokeh wash-out; era mismatch props; mottled peeling damp wall as default backdrop, generic aged wood tabletop, dim yellow tungsten interior as default",
    "examples": [
